 SG_ DI_epbParkRequest : 38|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Receiver
 SG_ DI_epbInterfaceReady : 39|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Receiver
 SG_ DI_torque2Checksum : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Receiver

